    "title": "Fishing guide shares secret to big kokanee days at Lake Billy Chinook - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brooke Snavely, Reporter ,\n20 hours ago LAKE BILLY CHINOOK, Ore. -- If you want to catch fish this time of year, Lake Billy Chinook is probably one of the best places to try your luck. The lake is giving up limits of kokanee salmon to those who use down riggers — a specialized form of trolling gear. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
